TITLE Simplify
VERSION 170

BUTTON NX_REFINE_SIMPLIFY
LABEL Auto Simplify
BITMAP optimize
ACTIONS NXRefine("simplify")

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REMOVE_SMALL
LABEL Small Faces
BITMAP delete
ACTIONS NXRefine("remove-small")

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REMOVE_BLENDS
LABEL Remove Blends
BITMAP edge_blend
ACTIONS NXRefine("remove-blends")

BUTTON NX_REFINE_FILL_HOLES
LABEL Fill Holes
BITMAP hole
ACTIONS NXRefine("fill-holes")

BUTTON NX_REFINE_REMOVE_MARKINGS
LABEL Remove Markings
BITMAP text
ACTIONS NXRefine("remove-markings")

